    "m_Title": "03 / Original deltaW formula",
    "m_Content": "deltaW = 0.2 * (-0.03 - 0.3 * max(0, 0.3 - d))\n           * Hover * distanceSquared / max(2 - d, 0.1)\nFinal change = deltaW * Strength. All arithmetic is nodes.",
